==Trivia==
*On release, the brutal black dragon did not have a Slayer requirement and could drop the dragon full helm at the same rate as [[mithril dragon]]s. However, being far easier to kill with minimal requirements, this was changed following player concerns about resources entering the game and devaluing the mithril dragons' only unique drop.
** The added slayer requirement has also made them the only chromatic dragon requiring a Slayer level to be harmed.
*The Magic attack projectile of the brutal black dragon resembles [[Iban Blast]].
*Brutal black dragons are the only monster to have two items from the mega-rare subtable of the [[rare drop table]] on their standard drop table ([[rune spear|rune]] and [[dragon spear]]s).

